$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
	"\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Mundala III" @
	"\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The surface of Mundula III has been ravaged by tribal war so many times that there is little evidence of any human settlements.  The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> are locked in battle over a couple of old Imperial bunkers.  The flag that is an icon of each team must be captured 5 times to break their spirit and drive them from the area.  You never did like company.";